[15.4, "o", "\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n                               -- GUARD CATCH: SCOUT OVERSTATED --\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHandoff written and validated.\n**Target 1 ? variants confirmed with one correction:** edit_overwrite/edit_replace record only gen\n  _ai.system/operation.name (lib.rs 569-588, 622-639); exec_command builds ExecContext without cal\n  ling extract_and_set_trace_context inline ? but it is NOT skipped: exec_command_impl calls it at\n   tools/exec_command.rs:432. Scout overstated; behavior is identical, only call-site moved.\n**Target 2 ? test gap:** metrics_tests.rs makes loose field assertions only (no byte-for-byte JSON\n  L/span snapshots, no OTel capture tests exist). A golden test is scope creep; the issue requires\n   zero change, not new tests.\n**Target 3 ? approach A safe:** locks are three sequential `.lock().await.clone()` calls with one \n  await on emit_received_metric first; a helper preserves ordering visibly. Risk: naive unificatio\n  n would add gen_ai.tool.name to edit spans ? a behavior change. Leave span.record calls at call \n  sites or parameterize.\n**Recommendation:** Approach A, exec_command untouched.\n"]
